<h2>Indent Submitted</h2>
<p>An engineering indent has been submitted and is awaiting design completion details.</p>
<table width="100%" style="background-color: #0f172a; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #334155; padding: 15px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 0;">Indent Number:</td>
    <td style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 0;">{{indentNumber}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 0;">Product:</td>
    <td style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 0;">{{productName}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 0;">Requested By:</td>
    <td style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 0;">{{requestedBy}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 0;">Purpose:</td>
    <td style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 0;">{{purpose}}</td>
  </tr>
</table>
<p>To inspect the transaction, access the dashboard:</p>
<div align="center">
  <a href="{{transactionUrl}}" class="btn">Inspect Transaction</a>
</div>
